    sd:notes "Confirmed by viewing: 'Screenshot 5' (the document's own numbering skips 'Screenshot 4' entirely — not investigated further, too minor). A MiEdWorkforce-branded 'Payment successful' confirmation screen (checkmark, Amount paid $45.00, Payment details, confirmation-email notice, Back to home/Start a new credential application buttons) — direct, explicit evidence that MiEdWorkforce DOES render its own success page, corroborating 7.1.2/7.1.4 and contradicting comment 8's 'no message displayed' claim (see pay:Question_PaymentResultMessagingContradiction)." ;
    sd:definedIn pay:Fdd07Doc .
pay:WireframeBulkPaymentAndRefund a sd:SourceDocument ; sd:docType "wireframe" ;
