    sd:notes "Confirmed by viewing: 'Screenshot 6'. A 'Bulk payment and refund' screen scoped to one district ('Holt public school district'), with Temporary credential/Select type/Status filter dropdowns, a checkbox table (Unique Id/Name/Type/Fee/Status), Total amount/Total selected, and a Pay fee button — directly corroborates 7.3.1/7.3.2's filter dropdowns (also described in the Business Specifications' own 'dropdown boxes... Temporary Credential, Select Type, Status' bullet, which is actually about the AUDIT tables, not this payment screen — see pay:Question_AuditFilterDropdownsVsBulkPaymentScreen) and the per-application fee/status/select-multiple shape. Notably titled 'Bulk payment AND REFUND' even though no numbered Addendum story covers bulk refund selection by an end user (only pay:Op_RequestBulkRefund's own Credential-Admin-initiated API flow) — consistent with pay:Question_AddendumOmitsRefundFeature below." ;
